# ***City of Buffalo, NY: Operation Clean Sweep***

We love showing how our partners use the Tolemi platform in their daily work. This month, we're highlighting how the City of Buffalo used area-based scoring.

By combining local and federal data in BuildingBlocks, Buffalo identified where its Clean Sweep initiative would have the greatest impact and best serve vulnerable communities.

Scoring did more than guide site selection. It also gave the city a baseline to measure the program's success year over year.

[Read the full City of Buffalo case study](/blog/case-studies/city-of-buffalo-ny).
